  "display_title": "Stay With Me",
  "description": "“Are you prepared to handle what I’m about to do to you?” \n\nFor Choi Bom, running into Kang Doha for the first time seven years causes him great emotional unrest. On the one hand, he’s glad that Doha is safe and sound, but on the other, he’s angry. Angry at Doha for disappearing for so long, and angry at himself for still caring. So when Doha says he wants to apply for the position as Bom’s housekeeper, Bom wonders if this might be the perfect chance to sort through his tumultuous emotions. Except, Doha refuses to answer any personal questions, leaving Bom more confused than ever. Just why did Doha disappear, and what is it that’s brought him back? Any most importantly, how can Bom be sure that Doha will stay?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
